              },
              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Application/Views.fs",
                "line": 83,
                "quote": "HoldsWaiting = Holds.queueFor copy.Book library |> List.length"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "Whether a copy may be added (unknown book, duplicate copy, including duplicates inside the file) is decided by Tier 2's Catalog.addCopy. The fold applies each row to the library that already has the earlier rows, so Tier 3 does not run its own duplicate check. Branch validity comes from Catalog.findBranch. The holds count comes from Tier 2's Holds.queueFor. Tier 3 only parses CSV fields, numbers the lines in errors, and chooses the status text for display.",
            "score": 2
          },
