            "rationale": "The file is read through the existing Files port, and an unreadable file comes back as an explicit value. The import is persisted through the existing commit helper, which goes through the Store port, so all-or-nothing is a pure fold followed by one commit. The CLI only dispatches to UseCases.importCopies. The CLI backup line that uses JsonFileStore directly is existing code shown as context and is not added by this change.",
